OL,3,AMother and son riot ringleaders jailed 
OL,4,Afor 'disgraceful' acts                 
OL,6,FA mother and son described as          
OL,7,Fringleaders of rioting that targeted   
OL,8,Fethnic minorities have been jailed for 
OL,9,Fwhat a judge called their "disgraceful 
OL,10,Factivities".                           
OL,12,FKelvin Kane, 32, of HMP Maghaberry, was
OL,13,Fjailed for four years on Monday after  
OL,14,Fadmitting 17 charges connected with    
OL,15,Frioting in Ballymena in the summer of  
OL,16,F2025.                                  
OL,18,FHis mother Tracy Kane, 51, of Galgorm  
OL,19,FStreet in the town, was jailed for two 
OL,20,Fyears after admitting two counts       
OL,21,Fincluding encouraging and assisting her
OL,22,Fson's crimes.                          
